{"voice":"kokoro af_heart","speed":0.92,"pages":{"1":{"text":"“This is the fastest plane in the neighborhood,” Zech announced. He had folded his blue paper into a sharp, pointy nose, just like a jet.","src":"p1.mp3","dur":9.22,"t":[[0.18,0.5],[0.5,0.62],[0.62,0.8],[0.8,1.22],[1.22,1.66],[1.66,1.86],[1.86,1.94],[1.94,2.36],[2.88,3],[3,3.46],[4.16,4.32],[4.32,4.42],[4.42,4.64],[4.64,4.96],[4.96,5.14],[5.14,5.56],[5.56,5.82],[5.82,5.98],[5.98,6.32],[6.6,6.98],[6.98,7.24],[7.66,7.94],[7.94,8.16],[8.16,8.28],[8.28,8.5]]},"2":{"text":"Corey folded a wide orange plane. “Mine is built for smooth flying,” he said. At the top of the hill, Zech's spun into a bush and Corey's dipped into the grass.","src":"p2.mp3","dur":11.3,"t":[[0.3,0.46],[0.46,0.96],[0.96,1.14],[1.14,1.46],[1.46,1.88],[1.88,2.46],[3.2,3.54],[3.54,3.82],[3.82,4.06],[4.06,4.26],[4.26,4.52],[4.52,5],[5,5.58],[5.58,5.84],[6.42,6.52],[6.52,6.62],[6.62,6.82],[6.82,6.98],[6.98,7.06],[7.06,7.32],[7.66,7.88],[7.88,8.28],[8.28,8.6],[8.6,8.74],[8.74,8.94],[8.94,9.24],[9.24,9.74],[9.74,9.9],[9.9,10.16],[10.16,10.28],[10.28,10.54]]},"3":{"text":"“Mine needs to go faster,” Zech said. “Mine needs to stay up longer,” Corey said. They sat in the grass and studied their bent planes.","src":"p3.mp3","dur":9.2,"t":[[0.12,0.54],[0.54,0.82],[0.82,1.06],[1.06,1.18],[1.18,1.68],[2.08,2.16],[2.16,2.54],[3.22,3.42],[3.42,3.72],[3.72,3.98],[3.98,4.18],[4.18,4.36],[4.36,4.8],[5.14,5.26],[5.26,5.7],[6.12,6.32],[6.32,6.48],[6.48,6.68],[6.68,6.74],[6.74,6.96],[6.96,7.28],[7.28,7.56],[7.56,7.8],[7.8,7.98],[7.98,8.36]]},"4":{"text":"“What if we try one of your sharp folds and one of my wide wings?” Corey asked. Zech’s eyes lit up, and he grabbed a fresh sheet of paper. “Let’s build it together!”","src":"p4.mp3","dur":10.7,"t":[[0.12,0.42],[0.42,0.5],[0.5,0.6],[0.6,0.78],[0.78,1.04],[1.04,1.14],[1.14,1.24],[1.24,1.5],[1.5,1.88],[1.88,2.34],[2.34,2.5],[2.5,2.58],[2.58,2.72],[2.72,2.94],[2.94,3.6],[3.96,4.12],[4.12,4.48],[5.56,5.72],[5.72,5.96